OL,3,GNEWSARail commuters face tough winter,
OL,4,AMPs warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe south-west of England is bracing
OL,7,Fitself for a winter of possible
OL,8,Fdisruption on the railways, MPs have
OL,9,Fwarned.
OL,11,FThe vulnerability of the coastal line
OL,12,Fbetween Exeter and Plymouth, ongoing
OL,13,Fdelays on the line between Exeter and
OL,14,FWaterloo and disruption due to be
OL,15,Fcaused by work on the HS2 super station
OL,16,Fat Old Oak Common are all causing
OL,17,Fconcern.
OL,19,FThere are also calls for money to be
OL,20,Fspent on the wi-fi service to allow
OL,21,Ftravellers to work on the trains.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
